//必ずしもそうとは思えない節があるが……。
  Much depends on Captain Otori's personal stance. Is her loyalty to the West absolute? I have reason to believe that may not be the case, but much remains uncertain.

//【舞殿宮】
<voice name='舞殿宮' class='舞殿宮' src='voice/ma03/0041190a10'>
