"This result, however, differed considerably from the Allies' original plan―or, more accurately, from Britain's. Yamato is the gateway to the Far East. Total control of it is essential to Britain's dream of world conquest."

//【香奈枝】
<voice name='香奈枝' class='香奈枝' src='voice/ma03/0041380a03'>
