//　親王はどうするつもりなのか……。
  The commissioner looks away. There must be nothing more to get out of the captain.

  Though the prince's face is hidden behind the screen, I can feel his frustration.

  Deception concealed in honesty, honesty concealed in deception. The prince isn't the only one thrown off by the captain's methods.

