"...Sure, that works. Please do as he asks. I'm counting on you to end these massacres and put my people's minds at ease."

//　朧な影が頭を下げる。
//　――この瞬間に、決定は下されてしまった。
  The silhouette bows his head.

  And thus, the decision is made.

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/ma03/0041690a00'>
